OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Twenty-six Liverpool football fans are
OL,6, to be extradited to Belgium to face
OL,7, charges of manslaughter in connection
OL,8, with the Heysel stadium disaster.
OL,10,FHome Secretary Mr Douglas Hurd said it
OL,11,Fwas right that the trial should take
OL,12,Fplace "where the harm was caused" and
OL,13,Fhe was confident that the 26 would get
OL,14,Fa fair and speedy trial.
OL,16,FBelgian Justice Minister Mr Jean Gol
OL,17,Fwelcomed Mr Hurd's decision.
OL,19,FThirty-nine people died in the riot at
OL,20,Fthe match between Liverpool and the
OL,21,FItalian side Juventus in May 1985.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
