OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Attacks on shipping in the Gulf by both
OL,6, Iran and Iraq have intensified
OL,7, overnight.
OL,9,FIran attacked five more foreign ships -
OL,10,Ffour tankers and a cargo vessel - from
OL,11,FSpain, Japan, South Korea, Cyprus and
OL,12,FGreece.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FLater, Iraq said its planes had
OL,15,Fhit three "large maritime targets"
OL,16,Foff the Iranian coast.
OL,18,S/FFrance has ordered three minehunters
OL,19,Fto the Gulf of Oman to start operations
OL,20,Fto clear mines in international waters.
OL,21,                  F
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
