OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Wiltshire police have appealed to the
OL,6, public to help them trace a car wanted
OL,7, in connection with an incident at the
OL,8, Northern Ireland Secretary's house.
OL,10,FIt is a yellow Datsun Bluebird saloon,
OL,11,Fregistration number FHE 80V. The car is
OL,12,Fsaid to be in a rough condition.
OL,14,FEarlier today, police using underwater
OL,15,Fsearch teams and tracker dogs searched
OL,16,Fa caravan site near Bath.
OL,18,FThey looked for evidence connected
OL,19,Fwith three people detained under the
OL,20,FPrevention of Terrorism Act over
OL,21,FSunday's incident at Mr Tom King's home
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
