OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Spanish air traffic controllers are
OL,6, due to strike from 7am on Saturday
OL,7, after a breakdown in pay talks.
OL,9,FA strike committee official in
OL,10,FBarcelona said the 24-hour strike
OL,11,Fwould go ahead unless the men got a
OL,12,Ffirm date for the payment of back pay.
OL,14,FLeaders of Spain's tourist industry
OL,15,Fhave met the tourism minister in Madrid
OL,16,Fin an attempt to mediate.
OL,18,FLast weekend a similar strike was
OL,19,Fcalled off at the last moment but a
OL,20,Fwalk-out the week before caused days
OL,21,Fof disruption for airline passengers.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
