OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Government has started a #5 million
OL,6, campaign against drug abuse and AIDS.
OL,8,FSocial Services Secretary Mr John Moore
OL,9,Fwarned of the dangers of sharing
OL,10,Fneedles and syringes and said as many
OL,11,Fas one in two drug addicts are infected
OL,12,Fwith the AIDS virus.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FThe adverts are designed to shock and
OL,15,Fuse graphic and explicit images. One
OL,16,Fshows a corpse in a polythene sheet
OL,17,Fwith an AIDS sticker attached.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FMr Moore has described the campaign as
OL,20,Fhard hitting and said that some people
OL,21,Fmight find it disturbing.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
